    "## Missing Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "We will calculate the percentage of missing values across all columns in our dataset to identify which columns are more than 80% empty. We then visualize these in an NA plot and save the result."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "2d602c3f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "\n",
      "Plot saved successfully to: outputs\\mostly_empty_columns_plot.png\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 768x1728 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {
      "image/png": {
       "height": 1718,
       "width": 768
      }
